2DA V1.0
*
# ethren (M3.1, M3.5): the names the funnel's rolling screen gives new peasants (renamed on the card at will), by
# species and sex: SEX is 1 male, 2 female (IE_SEX); RACE is race.ids (1 human, 2 elf, 4 dwarf, 5 halfling). Each
# card is given a name of every species with its other rolls, and shows the one of its species; a name isn't given
# twice in one roll. Our own lists: common medieval names for humans, and a sound of their own for the others.
